WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.445 --> 00:00:03.070
 First time I saw a poker game
was in a barber shop when I was

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:03.593
8-years-old.

00:00:03.593 --> 00:00:04.760
And I asked my grandfather--

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:05.950
I said, what were they doing?

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:06.790
He said, they were
playing poker.

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:08.080
I was hooked ever since.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.790
[MUSIC]

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:11.390
 Ivey shoves the river.

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.300
 Got a trick or
two up his sleeve.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.460
 Very intimidating
glare and a little smirk.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.770
 Welcome to Ivey's world.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.442
[MUSIC]

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.830
 You'd just love to get inside
his head for five minutes.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.435
[MUSIC]

00:00:24.935 --> 00:00:28.440
 To Paul Jackson, he has a
very famous hand in poker.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.650
I had queen, 8, he had 5, 6,
and the flop was jack, jack, 7.

00:00:34.272 --> 00:00:35.220
And I bet.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.370
He raised me.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:37.080
I re-raised him.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.405
 Both guys with nothing.

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:42.010
Key point was when I asked
him how much chips he had.

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:43.493
 $360.

00:00:43.493 --> 00:00:45.660
 The way he answered it
made me pretty confident he

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:47.770
didn't have anything.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:48.290
All in.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:48.820
 What?

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:52.210
It's just mind-blowing what we
just witnessed from Phil Ivey.

00:00:54.652 --> 00:00:56.610
I come from a generation
where the good players

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:59.580
knew talking about a hand or
helping someone to improve

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.170
was a big no-no.

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:07.830
But maybe it's time that I
share my keys for success.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.470
I'm Phil Ivey, and
this is my MasterClass.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.920
[MUSIC]

